{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>EVERY STEP IS A RISK. CAN YOU MAKE IT?</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think before you move. Once you move, your vision gets limited, and only memory and reflexes can save you. How fast are your reactions in the dark?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/41123f9a8355542ef67bf2832d1478ff.poster.avif?t=1761634661\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/41123f9a8355542ef67bf2832d1478ff.webm?t=1761634661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/41123f9a8355542ef67bf2832d1478ff.mp4?t=1761634661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>MOVE IN BIG, RISKY STEPS</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only have a limited number of lights each level. Move and stop too often, and you\u2019ll run out of lights and be in total darkness for the rest of the stage!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/41a413508ad86170c6a8b476e90f04af.poster.avif?t=1761634661\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/41a413508ad86170c6a8b476e90f04af.webm?t=1761634661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/41a413508ad86170c6a8b476e90f04af.mp4?t=1761634661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>GATHER PRECIOUS CRYSTALS &amp; GEMS</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each crystal and gem comes with its own unique challenge. Only the most skilled adventurers can uncover every lost treasure hidden in the darkness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/0ae726dd7d84fb92daca4b78c3771bae.poster.avif?t=1761634661\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/0ae726dd7d84fb92daca4b78c3771bae.webm?t=1761634661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/0ae726dd7d84fb92daca4b78c3771bae.mp4?t=1761634661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>BATTLE EPIC BOSS FIGHTS</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dr. Fog will do anything to keep the world in darkness. Only sharp reflexes, precise movement, and fearless determination will let you defeat his shadowy allies and ultimately face him!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/e554d3d3d712623ca2be74ec822ddca7.poster.avif?t=1761634661\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/e554d3d3d712623ca2be74ec822ddca7.webm?t=1761634661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/e554d3d3d712623ca2be74ec822ddca7.mp4?t=1761634661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the developer &amp; how this game came to life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi I\u2019m Ramy! Light Dude is my first ever video game on Steam! This whole game was born from suffering\u2026\u00a0I was walking back from the bathroom in the dark, confident I knew the layout of my own room... until my bed frame reminded me I didn\u2019t... My toe lost 99% of its HP, but at least I unlocked a new game idea!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/04a6be61080d0a0d03487980f0294cc4.poster.avif?t=1761634661\" width=616 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/04a6be61080d0a0d03487980f0294cc4.webm?t=1761634661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/04a6be61080d0a0d03487980f0294cc4.mp4?t=1761634661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Credits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logo Art : Wenart.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3055110?t=1761634661","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/04051bbb0075fc416fad653e109be6247c67ec41/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761634661","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/2a00e22c6cd993172f440a0459cceb9e03786851/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761634661","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/2a00e22c6cd993172f440a0459cceb9e03786851/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761634661","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"S